Unlike ''[[Tekken 4]]'', [[Combot]] no longer mimics a single character's moveset. Instead, in ''[[Tekken Tag Tournament 2]]'', Combot can mimic multiple character moves. More moves are unlocked by completing the levels of [[Fight Lab]], but special moves are only available after earning high ranks in the mode.

